+       /* The right-click flyout. `fixed` rather than `absolute`, because
+          the menu is positioned from a MouseEvent's clientX/clientY and
+          those are viewport coordinates - an absolutely positioned menu
+          would drift by the scroll offset the moment the page had one. */
+       #object-menu {
+         position: fixed;
+         display: flex;
+         flex-direction: column;
+         box-sizing: border-box;
+         width: max-content;
+         min-width: min(150px, calc(100vw - 16px));
